{# THE IDENTITY BAND — structural facts only, byte-identical on every tab and
   on every configure section.

   HOW THE PARK IS SET UP, never what is happening in it. How many rangers are
   on the books, how many posts run a watch, how many rotations, how big the
   shift vocabulary is, how often a handset pings, how far the generator has
   run. A live figure here would read differently on each of six tabs showing
   the same minute; live figures are the KPI row's job.

   `.factband` is the SHELL's component and is not restated in this module's
   sheet — one band, one set of rules, wherever a module draws one.

   NULL AND ZERO ARE DIFFERENT FACTS. "No rotation has generated yet" is not
   "generated to today", so the last field says so in words rather than
   printing a date nobody set.

   EVERY SUB-LINE IS A WHOLE FRAGMENT, and that is not a style note. The
   rangers line read "posted at the 1" — a sentence with the noun missing,
   which is what happens when a count is dropped into copy written for the
   plural. Each of these now reads as a phrase at every count it can hold,
   nought and one included. #}
<div class="factband">
    <span class="f"><span class="k">Rangers</span><span class="v">{{ band.rangers }}<em>{% if band.postsWithAWatch %}posted at {{ band.postsWithAWatch }} post{{ band.postsWithAWatch == 1 ? '' : 's' }}{% else %}no post runs a watch{% endif %}</em></span></span>
    <span class="f"><span class="k">Posts with a watch</span><span class="v">{{ band.postsWithAWatch }}<em>of the area&rsquo;s {{ band.stationsInArea }}</em></span></span>
    <span class="f"><span class="k">Rotations</span><span class="v">{{ band.rotations }}<em>{{ band.rotationsPerPost }} per post &middot; {{ band.rotationsPerTeam }} per team</em></span></span>
    <span class="f"><span class="k">Named shifts</span><span class="v">{{ band.namedShifts }}<em>{{ band.shiftLabels }}</em></span></span>
    <span class="f"><span class="k">Ping interval</span><span class="v">{{ band.pingIntervalMinutes }}<em>min</em></span></span>
    <span class="f"><span class="k">Generated to</span>
        {%- if band.generatedThrough %}
            <span class="v"><time datetime="{{ band.generatedThrough.format('Y-m-d') }}" data-localtime-format="day">{{ band.generatedThrough.format('j') }}</time><em>{{ band.generatedThrough.format('M')|lower }}</em></span>
        {%- else %}
            <span class="v">&mdash;<em>nothing generated yet</em></span>
        {%- endif %}
    </span>
    <span class="sp"></span>
    <a class="more" href="{{ path(constant('Uhifadhi\\Roster\\Controller\\RosterConfigureController::SETTINGS_ROUTE'), {uuid: area.uuid}) }}">Roster settings &rarr;</a>
</div>
